S-She's your sister?

20:07.220 --> 20:08.930
What a shocker.

20:08.930 --> 20:12.730
Iwasaki-kun and
Iwasaki-sensei are siblings.

20:13.310 --> 20:16.060
Sorry for barging in on you like that.

20:16.770 --> 20:18.230
What do you want?

20:18.230 --> 20:20.940
Normally, women run <i>from</i> you,

20:20.940 --> 20:23.910
not <i>to</i> you, Kouhei.

20:23.910 --> 20:25.660
I didn't bring her here!

20:26.120 --> 20:28.540
What're you even doing here, Aneki?

20:28.540 --> 20:32.290
Ever since you moved out on your own,
you've hardly ever come home.

20:32.290 --> 20:35.790
There's nothing wrong with
dropping by the old family house.

20:40.960 --> 20:46.050
I tried to deliver a replacement umbrella,
but ended up borrowing it myself.

20:49.850 --> 20:51.640
I'm home.

20:51.640 --> 20:54.140
Welcome home, Darling.

20:54.140 --> 20:56.650
Say, did your father stop by?

20:56.020 --> 20:56.650
Huh?

20:57.360 --> 20:59.230
This umbrella...

20:59.230 --> 21:00.780
W-Well, that's...

21:03.820 --> 21:06.990
It's not like I did anything to feel guilty about, but...

21:06.990 --> 21:10.870
I see. The rain stopped,
so he forgot to take his umbrella.

21:11.120 --> 21:14.250
Y-Yes, he was in a hurry.

21:14.250 --> 21:16.580
And now I'm telling a lie.

21:16.580 --> 21:20.170
Here's one of those cheesecakes you love so much.

21:20.170 --> 21:22.670
Wah! I'm so happy!

21:23.590 --> 21:26.010
I'm sorry, Darling.

21:26.010 --> 21:29.010
I didn't want you to get all worried.

21:33.600 --> 21:35.100
Delicious!

21:35.100 --> 21:37.100
Is it? I'm glad you like it.

21:37.440 --> 21:40.020
Darling... I love you.

21:41.190 --> 21:43.150
Asami...

21:43.150 --> 21:47.320
When I return the umbrella,
I'll firmly reject the modeling offer.

21:47.320 --> 21:51.870
Because I want my mind, body, and soul to belong...

21:51.870 --> 21:54.040
...to my husband alone.

21:54.040 --> 21:58.540
So please, keep loving me forever, 'kay?

22:15.810 --> 22:19.310
All I am is a kitten

22:15.810 --> 22:19.310
watashi wa koneko

22:19.310 --> 22:23.230
All for you, and yours alone

22:19.310 --> 22:23.230
anata hitori dake no

22:23.230 --> 22:30.120
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:23.230 --> 22:30.120
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.660 --> 22:34.160
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.660 --> 22:34.160
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:34.160 --> 22:38.330
and every last thing that I desire?

22:34.160 --> 22:38.330
kotaete yukeru kana

22:38.330 --> 22:41.750
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:38.330 --> 22:41.750
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:41.750 --> 22:47.670
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:41.750 --> 22:47.670
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

22:47.670 --> 22:55.060
Your kisses are like love vitamins,
so give me more and more of them.

22:47.670 --> 22:55.060
ai no bitamin kiss motto choudai

22:55.060 --> 23:01.980
Wrapped inside your loving arms so tight,
I can sleep again tonight.

22:55.060 --> 23:01.980
itoshii ude no naka kyou mo nemuru no

23:02.610 --> 23:12.120
Forever and ever only yours; just a kitten of love.

23:02.610 --> 23:12.120
zutto anata dake no ai no koneko

23:29.010 --> 23:44.940
Preview

23:29.920 --> 23:31.260
Asami here.

23:31.630 --> 23:35.680
As I feared, it seems like Iwasaki-sensei <i>does</i> love my husband.

23:36.140 --> 23:39.430
But she's not the only one!

23:39.430 --> 23:43.270
So please, love me lots next week too.
